/Extend your program to load and display the numbers (starting from memory location HEX 020). 
/Continuing from part (a), once the user enters a number ‘0’, 
/your program should terminate the number entry 
/and load these numbers from memory to display one after the other in the output window.
Loop,       Input
            Skipcond 400    /如果用户输入等于0，就跳过下一行
            Jump storeData  /去存储数据
            Jump storeZero  /去在指针末尾存0
storeData,  StoreI pointer  /把数据存进指针指向的第一个地址
            Load pointer    /加载指针里存的地址值
            Add One         /把指针存的地址值 + 1
            Store pointer   /把更新后的地址存进指针
            Jump Loop
storeZero,  Load Zero
            StoreI pointer
            Load StartAddr  /重置指针到最开始的地址
            Store pointer
outputNum,  LoadI pointer
            Skipcond 400    /如果pointer里面的东西等于0，跳过下一行
            Jump outputNow
            Halt
outputNow,  Output
            Load pointer
            Add One
            Store pointer
            Jump outputNum
Zero,       hex 0
One,        hex 1
pointer,    hex 020
StartAddr,  hex 020